  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 3813,
      "text": "[They will be asked], “What is the matter with you, that you no longer help one another?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3814,
      "text": "Rather on that Day they will surrender completely.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3815,
      "text": "They will turn to one another, reproaching one another.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3816,
      "text": "[The followers] will say, “It was you who used to delude us from the right way[6].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3817,
      "text": "[The misleaders] will say, “Rather, you yourselves were not believers,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3818,
      "text": "and We had no power over you, rather you yourselves were a transgressing people.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3819,
      "text": "Now the punishment of our Lord has come true against us; we will surely taste it.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3820,
      "text": "We did misguide you, for we ourselves were misguided”.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3821,
      "text": "On that Day they will all share in the punishment.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3822,
      "text": "This is how We deal with the wicked,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3823,
      "text": "for whenever it was said to them, “None has the right to be worshiped except Allah,” they became arrogant,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3824,
      "text": "and said, “Are we going to abandon our gods for a mad poet[7]?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3825,
      "text": "Rather, he came with the truth and confirmed the messengers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3826,
      "text": "You will surely taste the painful punishment,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3827,
      "text": "and you will only be recompensed for what you used to do,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
